OL,3,GNEWSAFormer Welsh rugby international  
OL,4,Adies at 42                             
OL,6,FFormer Wales under-21s rugby star James
OL,7,FIreland has died in Bermuda, his club  
OL,8,Fhas announced.                         
OL,10,FThe 42-year-old played for Italy's     
OL,11,FRugby Parma, and Newport's Dragons RFC,
OL,12,Fwhich said it was "deeply saddened".   
OL,14,FRugby Parma said Ireland's death was a 
OL,15,Fgrave loss for the Gialloblu family.   
OL,17,FIt said he was with the Italia Classic 
OL,18,Fteam competing in the World Rugby      
OL,19,FClassic in Bermuda when he died.       
